  "english": [
    "<b>would stand</b> and pass <b>from</b> a <b>sunny</b> spot <b>to</b> a <b>shady</b> one, <b>and from</b> a <b>shady</b> spot <b>to</b> a <b>sunny</b> one, so that they would always sit in comfort and never have cause to remark that they were uncomfortable in Eretz Yisrael. <b>Rabbi Ḥiyya bar Gamda would roll in the dust of</b> the land, <b>as it is stated: “For Your servants take pleasure in her stones, and love her dust”</b> (Psalms 102:15).",
    "The Gemara continues to discuss the messianic age. <b>Rabbi Zeira said</b> that <b>Rabbi Yirmeya bar Abba said:</b> In <b>the generation in which the son of David</b> will <b>come</b> there will be <b>indictments [<i>kateigorya</i>],</b> i.e., denouncements and incitements <b>against Torah scholars. When I said this before Shmuel he said:</b> The generation will undergo <b>refinement after refinement,</b> i.e., several stages of cleansing, <b>as it is stated: “And if there be a tenth in it, it shall again be eaten up”</b> (Isaiah 6:13). <b>Rav Yosef taught</b> about the messianic era: <b>Despoilers and despoilers of despoilers</b> will plunder Eretz Yisrael at that time.",
    "<b>Rav Ḥiyya bar Ashi said</b> that <b>Rav said: In the future all barren trees in Eretz Yisrael will bear fruit, as it is stated: “For the tree bears its fruit, the fig tree and the vine yield their strength”</b> (Joel 2:22). This verse indicates that every tree, not just the fig and vine, will produce fruit.",
    "May we return to you, chapter “the judges of decrees” and this is the completion\n"
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>קָיְימִי מִשִּׁמְשָׁא לְטוּלָּא וּמִטּוּלָּא לְשִׁמְשָׁא. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"of Rav, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2578\" data-full-name=\"of Rav\" data-name-he=\"רב\">רַבּ</span>ִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חִיָּיא בַּר גַּמָּדָא מִיגַּנְדַּר בְּעַפְרַהּ, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״כִּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "רָצוּ עֲבָדֶיךָ אֶת אֲבָנֶיהָ וְאֶת עֲפָרָהּ יְחוֹנֵנוּ״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Zeira I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1017\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Zeira I\" data-name-he=\"רַבִּי זֵירָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"default_early_context\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;heuristic&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Default early context&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology disambiguation heuristics&quot;}]\">רַבִּי זֵירָא</span> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yirmeya bar Abba I, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1954\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yirmeya bar Abba I\" data-name-he=\"רב ירמיה בר אבא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-41695\">רַבִּי יִרְמְיָה</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yirmeya bar Abba I, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1954\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yirmeya bar Abba I\" data-name-he=\"רב ירמיה בר אבא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-41695\">בַּר אַבָּא</span>: דּוֹר שֶׁבֶּן דָּוִד בָּא — קָטֵיגוֹרְיָא בְּתַלְמִידֵי חֲכָמִים. כִּי אַמְרִיתַהּ קַמֵּיהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Shmuel II, first-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2763\" data-full-name=\"Shmuel II\" data-name-he=\"שמואל\">דִּשְׁמוּאֵל</span> אֲמַר צֵירוּף אַחַר צֵירוּף, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״וְעוֹד בָּהּ עֲשִׂירִיָּה וְשָׁבָה וְהָיְתָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "לְבָעֵר״. תָּנֵי <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yosef I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1764\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yosef I\" data-name-he=\"רב יוסף בר חייא\">רַב יוֹסֵף</span>: בָּזוֹזֵי, וּבָזוֹזֵי דְבָזוֹזִי. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Ashi, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1102\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥiyya bar Ashi\" data-name-he=\"רב חייא בר אשי\">רַב חִיָּיא בַּר אָשֵׁי</span> אָמַר רַב:",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "עֲתִידִין כׇּל אִילָנֵי סְרָק שֶׁבְּאֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל שֶׁיִּטְעֲנוּ פֵּירוֹת, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״כִּי עֵץ",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "נָשָׂא פִרְיוֹ תְּאֵנָה וָגֶפֶן נָתְנוּ חֵילָם״<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"560\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><br><br><big><strong>הֲדַרַן עֲלָךְ שְׁנֵי דַּיָּינֵי גְזֵירוֹת וּסְלִיקָא לַהּ מַסֶּכֶת כְּתוּבּוֹת</strong></big><br><br>",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    }
  ],
